WaveHelm
========

Original project author and director:

- Pastoris Marco Vincenzo

Authorship note:

WaveHelm is an AI-assisted software project developed under the direction of Pastoris Marco Vincenzo.
The original project direction includes concept, product direction, AI orchestration, architectural guidance, validation, iterative refinement, documentation decisions, release direction, and publication choices.

Public repository note:

This GPL source repository is intended to preserve original authorship attribution while allowing public review,
learning, use, modification, and redistribution under the repository license.


Section 7 additional-terms note:

Redistributed and modified versions must preserve original authorship attribution, mark modified versions as different from the original, and avoid presenting forks or altered builds as official WaveHelm releases.
See GPL_SECTION7_ADDITIONAL_TERMS.md for the full wording.
